.env
*.env
bin/
out/
data/cache/
data/fixtures/
*.jsonl

# Local mirrors of Nansen's own API documentation, pulled with `curl` for
# reference while building. They are Nansen's material, not ours, and have no
# business being redistributed from a public repo. docs/DESIGN.md, DEMO.md and
# SUBMISSION.md are written here and stay tracked.
docs/*.md
!docs/DESIGN.md
!docs/DEMO.md
!docs/SUBMISSION.md
